Scope

The MIT License above covers the source code of tecupid. It does not cover the
following content, which remains Copyright (c) 2026 yonu33, all rights reserved:

- The text of the feature cards and the technology and topic summaries
  (the Japanese text in src/data/cards.ts and src/data/technologies.ts)
- The pixel art (src/components/sprites.ts, public/favicon.svg, public/og/)
- The documents in docs/ and the site's legal pages (src/pages/terms.astro,
  src/pages/privacy.astro, src/pages/disclaimer.astro, src/pages/about.astro)

